# 🎓 Key Learnings

- Recruiters often decide whether to continue viewing a profile within seconds.
- A compelling headline and strong About section dramatically improve first impressions.
- Achievement-focused experience descriptions are more impactful than responsibility lists.
- Strategic keywords increase visibility in LinkedIn recruiter searches.
- Personal branding is built through consistency, clarity, and value—not just job titles.

